                             Node functions
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

Online F-Key Functions
----------------------

 [F1]  =  Chat in/out, go in/out of chat.
 [F2]  =  Temporary sysop access grant / remove.
          Give SysOp accesslevel to user online. Access will be removed
          when user is logging off, or when [F2] is pressed again.
 [F4]  =  capture file (ONLY THE SYSOP CAN SEE THIS).
          If a capture file has allready been opened it will
          be closed and sysop will be informed.
 [F6]  =  Account edit, account edit online user.
 [SF6] =  Quick access, BBS:PRESETS/PRESET_1 will be given to the user.
                        or specified preset in preferences setup.
 [F7]  =  Toogle chat, toogles wheter you are to be paged or not, users with
          ACS_OVERRIDE_CHAT turned on, can page the sysop EVEN if chat is off.
 [F8]  =  Users time +10mins, increase users online time with +10 mins.
 [SF8] =  Users time -10mins, decrease users online time with -10 mins.
 [F9]  =  Binary send to user, same as ASCII SEND to user, but this is for
          transfering binary files. (IE: DIRECT UPLOAD TO USER)
 [SF9] =  Binary receive
 [F10] =  Drop DTR on user, disconnect the user currently online.

Offline F-Key Functions
-----------------------

 [F1]  =  Sysop Login, let you login as the SYSOP
 [F2]  =  Local Login, let you make a standard login. (LIKE FROM REMOTE)
 [F3]  =  Instant Login, sends the ANSWER STRING to the modem (IE: ATA),
          this is for switching from voice to data.
 [F4]  =  Reserve for a user, let's the SYSOP reserve the node for a certain
          user, no other users can login, when the user the node is reserved
          for logs off, the node is resetted to original state.
 [F6]  =  Account Edit, This open the Account Editor on the node and put's
          the modem OFFHOOK until the Account Editor is closed again.
 [F7]  =  Toogle Chat, toogles wheter you are to be paged or not, Users with
          ACS_OVERRIDE_CHAT turned on can page the sysop EVEN if chat is off.
 [F8]  =  User credit accountance. View/Edit users Freedownload account.
 [F9]  =  Exit BBS, closes the node for REMOTE calls.
 [F10] =  Exit BBS (OFF HOOK), closes the node for REMOTE calls, and puts the
          modem offhook.

